<h3>ACTIONS</h3></div><div class=\"zt-cb-body\"><ul id=\"isPasted\"><li>Split the passenger if needed/permitted and link the PNR in Edvin&nbsp;<br><br></li><li>Take all necessary actions to finalize the rebooking<br>&nbsp;<ul><li><strong><u>GDS &amp; Farelogix</u></strong>:&nbsp;<ul><li style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><strong>If it is Void &amp; Rebook, VOID the ticket and EMDs in the GDS. Do NOT use the automation.</strong></li><li>Save the new flights and remove the old ones</li><li>Save the pricing&nbsp;</li><li>Send to ticketing for reissue by using the rebooking wizard.<br><br></li></ul></li><li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><u><strong>External Portals:&nbsp;</strong></u><ul style=\"font-weight: initial;\"><li style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>If it is Void &amp; Rebook, VOID the ticket and EMDs in the Portal. Do NOT use the automation.</strong></li><li>Finalize the rebooking steps within the portal.</li><li>If the form of payment is CASH, place the order in the UPA TKT - \"Close D365 External portals\"</li><li>Send the confirmation/new tickets to the customer</li><li>Register errand<br><br></li></ul></li><li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong><u>LCC</u></strong><ul style=\"font-weight: initial;\"><li>Finalize the rebooking steps on the airline's website</li><li>Send the confirmation/new tickets to the customer</li><li>Register errand</li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\" id=\"isPasted\">If the form of payment is TFpay, place the order in the UPA TKT - \"Close D365 External portals\"<br><br></li></ul></li></ul></li><li>If you have created a new PNR link it in Edvin.<br><br></li><li>Change the order in Edvin&nbsp;</li></ul></div></div><p><br></p><div class=\"zt-content-block zt-cb-type-alert\"><div class=\"zt-cb-title\"><i class=\"zt-cb-icon\" contenteditable=\"false\"></i><h3>ATTENTION</h3></div><div class=\"zt-cb-body\"><p>If the customer used the Flexible Ticket Service - Re